+/// A turned rectangle box shadows can be clipped to ([`Window::with_shadow_clip`]):
+/// `to_clip` maps scaled pixels to the rectangle's own space, where it spans `size` from the
+/// origin (so the map is a rotation and a translation, keeping pixel distances for the
+/// anti-aliasing).
